---
import Layout from "../../../layouts/Layout.astro";

const currentYear = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<Layout title="Publicar | El Alma de las Flores">
  <main class="relative isolate overflow-hidden bg-paper text-ink">
    <div
      aria-hidden="true"
      class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-x-0 top-0 -z-20 h-[22rem] bg-[radial-gradient(circle_at_12%_20%,_rgba(143,163,130,0.2),_transparent_34%),radial-gradient(circle_at_88%_5%,_rgba(217,164,65,0.1),_transparent_32%),linear-gradient(110deg,_#edf0e8_0%,_#f3f0e6_48%,_#f5eee5_100%)]"
    ></div>
    <svg
      aria-hidden="true"
      class="pointer-events-none absolute right-[-4rem] top-4 -z-10 hidden h-64 w-64 text-moss/20 lg:block"
      viewBox="0 0 240 240"
      fill="none"
    >
      <path d="M202 9C154 66 119 132 97 224" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4"></path>
      <path d="M171 55c-29-5-47 7-57 35 28 3 47-9 57-35Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2"></path>
      <path d="M139 112c-31-3-50 11-58 41 30 1 49-13 58-41Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2"></path>
      <path d="M120 162c18-21 39-25 63-13-18 20-39 25-63 13Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2"></path>
    </svg>

    <header class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-5 pb-16 pt-8 sm:px-8 sm:pb-20 sm:pt-10 lg:px-10">
      <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4">
        <p class="text-[0.68rem] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.34em] text-moss-text">
          Cuaderno de autor
        </p>
        <a
          href="/mis-publicaciones"
          class="group inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-semibold text-ink/70 transition-colors hover:text-ink"
        >
          Mis publicaciones
          <span aria-hidden="true" class="transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-1">→</span>
        </a>
      </div>
      <div class="mt-7 max-w-3xl">
        <h1 class="font-serif text-4xl font-bold leading-[0.95] tracking-tight text-ink sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl">
          Publicar en el blog
        </h1>
        <p class="mt-4 max-w-xl text-base leading-7 text-ink/70 sm:text-lg">
          Una nueva página para el cuaderno vivo. Porque tu palabra importa.
        </p>
      </div>
    </header>

    <section class="mx-auto -mt-9 max-w-6xl px-4 pb-16 sm:px-8 lg:px-10 lg:pb-24">
      <article class="overflow-hidden rounded-[1.25rem] border border-ink/12 bg-[#fffdf8] shadow-[0_20px_60px_rgba(44,85,48,0.08)]">
        <div class="grid border-b border-ink/10 px-5 py-6 sm:px-8 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_auto] lg:items-end lg:px-10">
          <div>
            <p class="text-[0.65rem] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-moss-text">
              Nueva entrada
            </p>
            <h2 class="mt-2 font-serif text-3xl font-semibold text-ink sm:text-4xl">
              Empieza a escribir
            </h2>
          </div>
          <p class="mt-3 max-w-md text-sm leading-6 text-ink/60 lg:mt-0 lg:text-right">
            Puedes publicar texto, imagen o ambos.<br class="hidden lg:block" /> Los campos se guardan al enviar.
          </p>
        </div>

        <form
          id="blog-form"
          class="opacity-60 transition-opacity duration-300"
          aria-describedby="blog-help publish-locked-message"
        >
          <div class="space-y-7 px-5 py-7 sm:px-8 sm:py-9 lg:px-10">
            <p
              id="publish-locked-message"
              class="rounded-xl border border-pollen/30 bg-pollen/10 px-4 py-3 text-sm leading-6 text-ink/75"
            >
              Estamos comprobando tu sesión para habilitar el cuaderno.
            </p>

            <label class="block space-y-2.5">
              <span class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4">
                <span class="text-[0.68rem] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-moss-text">
                  Título
                </span>
                <span id="blog-title-counter" class="text-xs tabular-nums text-ink/55" aria-live="polite">
                  0 / 120
                </span>
              </span>
              <input
                id="blog-title"
                data-publish-control
                type="text"
                name="title"
                maxlength="120"
                disabled
                placeholder="Ej. Flores que inspiran calma"
                class="min-h-14 w-full border-0 border-b border-ink/20 bg-transparent px-0 py-3 font-serif text-2xl text-ink outline-none transition-colors placeholder:text-ink/35 focus:border-moss focus:ring-0 disabled:cursor-not-allowed sm:text-3xl"
              />
            </label>

            <label class="block space-y-2.5">
              <span class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4">
                <span class="text-[0.68rem] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-moss-text">
                  Contenido
                </span>
                <span id="blog-content-counter" class="text-xs tabular-nums text-ink/55" aria-live="polite">
                  0 / 10.000
                </span>
              </span>
              <textarea
                id="blog-content"
                data-publish-control
                name="content"
                rows="7"
                maxlength="10000"
                disabled
                placeholder="Comparte la historia, reflexión o enseñanza del día…"
                class="min-h-56 w-full resize-y rounded-xl border border-ink/15 bg-paper/45 px-5 py-4 text-base leading-8 text-ink outline-none transition-[border-color,background-color,box-shadow] placeholder:text-ink/38 focus:border-moss/70 focus:bg-white focus:ring-2 focus:ring-moss/15 disabled:cursor-not-allowed"
              ></textarea>
            </label>

            <div class="grid gap-6 border-t border-ink/10 pt-7 lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1fr)_17.5rem] lg:gap-8">
              <div>
                <div class="mb-3 flex flex-col gap-1 sm:flex-row sm:items-end sm:justify-between sm:gap-4">
                  <p class="text-[0.68rem] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-moss-text">
                    Imagen destacada
                  </p>
                  <p class="text-xs text-ink/55">Horizontal · JPEG, PNG, WebP o GIF · máx. 10 MB</p>
                </div>

                <label
                  for="blog-image-input"
                  class="group relative block aspect-[16/7] min-h-52 cursor-pointer overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-dashed border-moss/45 bg-[linear-gradient(135deg,_rgba(143,163,130,0.1),_rgba(243,240,230,0.65))] transition-[border-color,background-color] hover:border-moss hover:bg-moss/10"
                >
                  <input
                    id="blog-image-input"
                    data-publish-control
                    type="file"
                    name="image"
                    accept="image/jpeg,image/png,image/webp,image/gif"
                    disabled
                    class="sr-only"
                  />
                  <img
                    id="blog-image-preview"
                    class="hidden h-full w-full object-cover"
                    alt="Vista previa de la imagen seleccionada"
                  />
                  <span
                    id="blog-image-placeholder"
                    class="flex h-full min-h-52 flex-col items-center justify-center px-6 py-8 text-center"
                  >
                    <span class="flex size-11 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-moss/30 bg-white/70 text-xl text-ink transition-transform group-hover:-translate-y-1" aria-hidden="true">＋</span>
                    <span class="mt-4 font-serif text-xl font-semibold text-ink">Añadir una imagen</span>
                    <span class="mt-1 text-sm leading-6 text-ink/60">Selecciona un archivo para verlo aquí</span>
                  </span>
                  <span class="absolute bottom-3 right-3 rounded-full bg-ink/85 px-4 py-2 text-xs font-semibold text-paper opacity-0 transition-opacity group-hover:opacity-100 group-focus-within:opacity-100">
                    Elegir imagen
                  </span>
                </label>
              </div>

              <aside class="flex flex-col rounded-xl border border-ink/10 bg-paper/55 p-5 lg:min-h-full">
                <p class="text-[0.68rem] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-moss-text">
                  Antes de publicar
                </p>
                <ul id="blog-help" class="mt-4 space-y-3 text-sm leading-6 text-ink/68">
                  <li class="flex gap-2.5"><span aria-hidden="true" class="text-pollen">✦</span><span>Revisa que el título explique bien la entrada.</span></li>
                  <li class="flex gap-2.5"><span aria-hidden="true" class="text-pollen">✦</span><span>Las imágenes horizontales lucen mejor en el anuario.</span></li>
                  <li class="flex gap-2.5"><span aria-hidden="true" class="text-pollen">✦</span><span>La publicación se incorpora al cuaderno del año actual.</span></li>
                </ul>

                <div class="mt-auto pt-7">
                  <p
                    id="blog-form-status"
                    role="status"
                    aria-live="polite"
                    class="mb-3 hidden rounded-xl border px-4 py-3 text-sm leading-6"
                  ></p>
                  <button
                    type="button"
                    id="blog-publish-button"
                    data-publish-control
                    disabled
                    class="inline-flex w-full items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-ink px-6 py-3.5 font-semibold text-paper shadow-[0_10px_24px_rgba(44,85,48,0.2)] transition-[transform,background-color] hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:bg-ink/92 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-moss/50 focus:ring-offset-2 disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-50"
                  >
                    Publicar entrada
                  </button>
                  <a
                    href={`/archivo/${currentYear}`}
                    class="mt-3 inline-flex w-full items-center justify-center py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-ink/65 transition-colors hover:text-ink"
                  >
                    Ver el anuario actual <span aria-hidden="true" class="ml-2">↗</span>
                  </a>
                </div>
              </aside>
            </div>
          </div>
        </form>
      </article>
    </section>
  </main>
</Layout>

<script src="../../../scripts/auth/guards/publish.js"></script>
<script src="../../../scripts/posts/publish/editor.ts"></script>
